    "text": "Arrange the bonds in order of increasing ionic character in the molecules. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LiF</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math>",
